[en.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_HOTLINE_2]
International Heating Hotline 2

[en.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_HOTLINE_2_desc]
Las Pegasus is now offering an international heating service... Though it’s a little expensive, it’s worth it to keep our citizens warm through this harsh winter.
But that’s no excuse for you price-gouging merchants to take advantage of the situation!

[zh.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_HOTLINE_2]
国际供暖热线 2

[zh.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_HOTLINE_2_desc]
洛马基现在正在提供国际供暖服务... 虽然有点贵，但为了让我们的市民在这个严冬中保持温暖，这是值得的。
但这也不意味着你们这些奸商可以坐地起价啊喂！
